Z||000023||Ken Wittlief||06-14-2001||11:11 PM||||I dont know guys<P>I like the way the wing looks on a Formula<P>and my '85 SE has the luggage rack and the 'trunk handle'<P>which I dont like at all. I was thinking of replacing the deck lid with one that has a full wing on it<P>but since I know they are not functional - like the vertical tail fins on a 59 caddy<P>and esp with all the crappy wings the ricers are putting on their cars - Im thinking a smooth deck lid is the way to go. Being wingless is fast approaching a 'statement'.<P> I also wonder how many mpgs the wing on a fiero takes off. The aerodynamics HAVE to be better without it at normal highway speeds.||||reg||13
